ksagar.site — personal website

Static HTML/CSS. No install or build step.
Page routes, layouts, styles, and content are preserved.

Repository layout
  index.html, craft.html, projects.html, research.html — existing pages
  work/index.html              — work page
  data/index.html              — teleoperation and data collection videos
  robotics/index.html          — robotics worklog
  robot-learning.html          — existing compatibility redirect
  assets/css/                  — unchanged stylesheets
  assets/js/                   — video playback helper
  assets/media/                — media grouped by project
    emg/, walle/, mario/        — hardware and workshop media
    robotics/, lab/, research/  — experiments and supporting images
    profile/                   — portraits; original JPGs in originals/
  data/media/                  — provenance manifests (repository-relative paths)
  data/inventories/            — source inventory CSVs
  docs/UPDATING.md             — editing and media preparation guide
  docs/audits/                 — source reviews and historical audit notes
  tools/                      — media preparation and local link validation

Run from the repository root:
  python3 -m http.server 8000 --bind 127.0.0.1
  python3 tools/check_site.py

Preview: http://127.0.0.1:8000/
Website: https://ksagar.site
